<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.6">
  <book code="EPH" style="id">Baebu Thyaa</book>
  <para style="h">EFESA</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ephesians</para>
  <para style="toc2">EFESA</para>
  <para style="toc3">Efe</para>
  <para style="mt1">EFESA HAE</para>
  <para style="mt2">KALAN PAUL CCAKY</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ephesians</para>
  <para style="imt">Byalaanmaw</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bk">Efesa hae kalan Paul Ccaky</char> hynh masaty lan, “Ccyh yn ccing te Pachia nynh rae lan a paccynkupaw tuh: vaawlang kya thuasah, laephi kya thuasah, raepaw uccaw balyn hynh marya suelua zah Khri kha lupi lang nung kha nynh athua cipaw hynh abyapi lante a nung (1.10). Te Pachia ccungccaw hae kya ccungccaw balyn nynh pynkheihlan thuanaw lanpaw hynh a paccyn huapaw athua hawte asuilan hoite hiin lanpaw kha a ngia hae.</para>
  <para style="ip">Hynh-e <char style="bk">Efesa</char> athotakawnaw kya ccawzeitu nynh ccangkheit thuanaw lanpaw paccynkunawpaw a ho. Hynh-e kya hynh Pachia nynh ccungccaw a ponaw zia te Thyaa Muisaw liate alepaw Pachia byakinnaw aamahkhannaw zia balyn a ho. Ccangningnaw kya ccawriatu hae kha Khri lungkhu kya ccangkheit athuanaw hae paw lu kheit te lu kheit ahmepaw mih hiinnaw ccangkheitpaw lang a ngia hae.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ccangkheitpaw Pachia ccaaw hae nynh Khri te a kyngkunaw hae liate langsakunaw lanpaw ho rypaw a langsakuhtu tousenaw kha mangte a ho, khriccaawbuu tuh pyn hawte thua zah, Khri tuh lu hawte nynh thua; khriccaawbuu tuh inn hawte thua zah Khri tuh inn apaki e lung hawte nynh thua; khriccaawbuu tuh zu hawte thua zah Khri tuh vawpaw hawte nynh thua a ci. Khri kya a langsahkupaw Pachia thawccinaw nynh ccawzeitu a tuanaw kha a hangsah. A hopaw balyn kya Khri sungsahnaw, a pyn pyakunaw, seingaethyanaw, thawccinaw te a thyaanaw hae kha oun muih sah.</para>
  <para style="iot">Alungkhu Umpaw</para>
  <para style="io1">Byalaanmaw — 1.1-2</para>
  <para style="io1">Khri te khriccaawbuu — 1.3—3.21</para>
  <para style="io1">Khri kya hiinnaw thawpaw — 4.1—6.20</para>
  <para style="io1">Athangnaw — 6.21-24</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Beihlangnaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pachia rynaw thyhte Khri Jesu locceihtu athuapaw Paul nynh Efesa khua e mithyaa hae te Khri Jesu kya lungzi hae paw kalan ccaw kae ky oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 18:19-21">Loc 18.19-21</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 19:1">19.1</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ah Paaw Pachia te Bawipaw Jesu Khri kya-e thawccinaw te daenaw tuh nae kya la um vae sah.</para>
  <para style="s1">Khri kya Muisaw Hythuanaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ah Bawipaw Jesu Khri a Paaw Pachia tuh thehoyte um sah. Pawccecize Khri liate vaawlang e muisaw hythuanaw aphuinphuin kha aening oun pya vae. <verse number="4" style="v" />Aening tuh Pachia malang ah thyaa nawlan oh te ccaenaw um leipaw ah thua nawlan oh, laephi rae mawze aening kha Khri kya phe oun po vae. <verse number="5" style="v" />Pachia nynh amaw a rynaw thyhte, Jesu Khri liate aening kha a ccaaw hae lang phe oun la paccynde vae, <verse number="6" style="v" />a sungsahpaw Ccapaw liate alakaw te aening oun pyapaw aphu-epaw a thawccinaw kha thehoysah khylan nynh thua. <verse number="7" style="v" />Khri chiise liate shawkhawnaw athuapaw aening seinaw ngaethyanaw kha myarya lepaw Pachia thawccinaw thyhte Ccapaw liate ah mue oh,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 1:14">Kol 1.14</ref></char></note> <verse number="8" style="v" />tuh-e thawccinaw tuh aening kha paepae lui lan oun pya vae. <verse number="9" style="v" />Pachia nynh Khri kya a paccyn ty vae paw ahoypaw a lungrythuanaw thyhte, hawnaw te thaethyanaw balyn khate a rynaw kya-e byakhupaw kha aening phe oun nysah vae, <verse number="10" style="v" />tuhcite accyh yn ccing te, vaawlang umpaw te laephi vaw umpaw pawpaw balyn kha Khri kya marya suelua lan a paccyn. <verse number="11" style="v" />Amaw a rynaw te a khuakhannaw thyhte pawpaw balyn a cyihtupaw Pachia nynh a eenaw thyhte a paccyn ty vae hawte aening mah Khri liate rhoccounaw kha ah mue oh, <verse number="12" style="v" />tuh-e tuh Khri kha masaty a ngaehoi hae paw aening nynh a phu-enaw kha thehoysah khylan ah hiin nawlan oh nynh thua. <verse number="13" style="v" />Nae kya-e khumnaw thehoypaw athuapaw byaccing bya kha he na thae oh te, amaw kha na zyn oh zah Pachia nynh bya a kinkupaw Thyaa Muisaw khate tazeihkhia na thua vae oh. <verse number="14" style="v" />Pachia nynh amaw ccungccaw lang oun shawkhawnaw konglang te, Muisaw tuh aening rho hanlan aamahkhan nynh thua, tuh-e tuh Pachia phu-enaw kha thehoysah nawlan nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="s1">Paul Sawsangnaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Bawipaw Jesu na zynnaw oh paw te mithyaa hae balyn na sungsahnaw oh paw kha he ka thae tuh, <verse number="16" style="v" />nanning hanlan Pachia kalan dae leite lungtuabya ka ho zah ka sawsangnaw kya tyty kae lia oh. <verse number="17" style="v" />Ah Bawipaw Jesu Khri a Pachia, phu-enaw Paaw nynh amaw ny nawlan hawnaw muisaw te byaphy kha ae pya nawlan oh thuasah, <verse number="18" style="v" />thaethya nawlan nae thinlung mit ae awsah oh zah, nanning ae konua oh paw ngaehoinaw tuh pawmou athua cipaw na ny nawlan oh thuasah, mithyaa hae nynh a ccou hae paw rho a phu-enaw tuh hohcihmou ale cipaw na ny nawlan oh thuasah, <verse number="19" style="v" />alesaepaw a thungnaw nynh rya a law thyhte, a zyn hae paw aening hanlan a thungnaw tuh tou kho um lei lan hohcihmou ale cipaw na ny nawlan oh thuasah saw kae sangpya oh. <verse number="20" style="v" />Khri kha chinaw kyate thoosah zah vaawlang khua kya a ranglang khe a haungsah lya, Pachia nynh tuh-e thungnaw khate Khri kya rya a law,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Sam 110.1</ref></char></note> <verse number="21" style="v" />Khri kha uknaw, kawhoinaw, thungnaw te peenaw kaw balyn kya ahanghua lante a haungsah, atu she kyalya thua leite yn thua cih paw she kyacia minphukuhpaw min miakaw kya ahanghua lante a nung. <verse number="22" style="v" />Pawpaw balyn kha Khri a ccuphe kaw marya nung zah khriccaawbuu hanlan pawpaw balyn kya lu lang a nung,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 8:6">Sam 8.6</ref></char></note><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.22-23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 1:18">Kol 1.18</ref></char></note> <verse number="23" style="v" />tuh-e khriccaawbuu tuh Khri pyn thua zah pawpaw balyn kha pawpaw balyn kyakhe phe a ccingsahtupaw Khri accingnaw nynh thua.</para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Chinaw kyate Hiinnaw lang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Langmawlya tuh kawngae leinaw te seinaw hae keiccu na la chih oh,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.1-5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 2:13">Kol 2.13</ref></char></note> <verse number="2" style="v" />tuh-e seinaw hae kyakhe na la hiin oh zah hynh-e laephi laanpi hynh na la zui oh, khivae kya-e thungnaw a uktu, kawngae lei hae paw kya atu ryalahpaw muisaw nulang zuikute na la hiin oh. <verse number="3" style="v" />Aening balyn tuh langmawlya tuh-e hae kyakhe pynsaw rynaw te thinlung rynaw kha zuite, ah pynsaw duaanaw kyakhe ah la ciakuh bua oh; mingccang hae hawte aening mah aphung thyhte thinrianaw a ccou hae paw ccaaw hae nynh ah la thua oh. <verse number="4" style="v" />Thuasalama ngaethyaumsahnaw te phe beihpaw Pachia nynh aening kha myarya alepaw a sungsahnaw te oun sungsah keiccuze, <verse number="5" style="v" />ah seinaw kya ah chi lya oh khe, Khri ryte pynkheihlan oun hiinsah vae—thawccinaw liate nanning tuh khum na thua vae oh— <verse number="6" style="v" />Khri Jesu ryte oun thoosah zah vaawlang khua kya amaw ryte oun haungsah vae, <verse number="7" style="v" />tuh-e tuh Khri Jesu liate aening ngaethya oun umsahnawpaw a thawccinaw myarya alepaw kha yn thua lanpaw she kya oun langsahpya nawlan nynh thua. <verse number="8" style="v" />Pawccecize thawccinaw keiccuze zynnaw liate khum na thua vae oh, tuh-e tuh naemaw nynh na cyiku oh paw thua khyh, Pachia lasung nynh thua. <verse number="9" style="v" />Ryalawnaw liate thua khyh, tukeiccuze hum nynh sanmah pooku lanpaw um khyh. <verse number="10" style="v" />Pawccecize aening tuh ahoypaw ryalaw law khylan Khri Jesu kya amaw nynh oun raepaw nynh ah thua oh; tuh-e ahoypaw ryalaw hae kya ah hiin nawlan oh Pachia nynh a la paccyn ty vae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Khri kya Ccangkheit</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tukeiccuze pynsaw kya kuih te vingdungawkuh hae paw nynh “vingdungawkuh lei hae paw” cite ae la ko oh paw nanning tuh langmawlya pynsaw lante Zenta hae na la thua oh paw kha liathui oh. <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuh ccyh lyaze nanning tuh Khri leite na la um oh paw, Israel ccazing kya umbua leite ramccang hae na thua oh paw, byakinpyakupaw byakinnaw te asekuh leipaw mikhia hae na la thua oh paw te ngaehoinaw hoi leite Pachia leite laephi kya na la um oh paw kha liathui oh. <verse number="13" style="v" />Thuasalama langmawlya kou na la sawkuh oh paw nanning kha atu tuh Khri chiise liate Khri Jesu kya naesaku na thua vae oh. <verse number="14" style="v" />Pawccecize aning tuh aening daenaw nynh thua; minphuin phuin ning kha amaw a pynsaw kyakhe phuin kheit lang rae zah aening laku arihkhawpaw rhawkunaw lungrua kha pong a tingsah vae. <verse number="15" style="v" />Aning nynh ccangpyakunaw hae kya a umpaw kawbya hae te phungzae hae kha roh zah, minphuin phuin ning kha amaw kya minphuin thawpaw phuin kheit lang rae zah daenaw kha a umsah.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 2:14">Kol 2.14</ref></char></note> <verse number="16" style="v" />Aning nynh vaelantung liate minphuin phuin ning kha pyn pynkheit lang sueluate Pachia te bua ccawsakuthui hae zah rhawkunaw kha a maemih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 1:20">Kol 1.20</ref></char></note> <verse number="17" style="v" />Khri tuh yn thua zah asawnaw na um oh paw nanning te anaenaw a um hae paw kyakhe daenaw thehoypaw kha a ho.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 57:19">Isa 57.19</ref></char></note> <verse number="18" style="v" />Pawccecize aening minphuin phuin ning tuh Khri liate Muisaw ccangkheit kyakhe Paaw kalan thua khonaw ah hoi oh. <verse number="19" style="v" />Tukeiccuze atu nanning tuh mikhia hae te minphuin ccang hae na thua vae khyh oh, mithyaa hae ryte khuaccaaw hae na thuakheih oh zah Pachia innbyn kya-e hae nynh na thua vae oh. <verse number="20" style="v" />Nanning tuh locceihtu hae te profeh hae nynh a bing hae paw aleihpaw vawlan sakthinpaw na thua oh zah, Khri Jesu tuh apaki lang e abyapi huapaw lung nynh thua. <verse number="21" style="v" />Amaw kya sakpaw inn tuh abalyn mawte rekuhmamia lan sak thua zah Bawipaw kya athyaapaw beikinn lang a lethung. <verse number="22" style="v" />Nanning kha mah Muisaw liate Pachia a umnaw hmin lang amaw kya pynkheihlan sak na thua oh.</para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Zenta hae hanlan Paul Ryalawnaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuh-e keiccuze kae, Paul tuh nanning Zenta hae hanlan Khri Jesu keiccu thongccahpaw nynh ka thua. <verse number="2" style="v" />Nanning hanlan Pachia nynh a thawccinaw liate kae yn pyapaw rya kong kha phe na thae mamin vae cih oh. <verse number="3" style="v" />Pachia nynh byakhupaw kha byaphy liate phe yn nysah vae; tuh-e kong tuh aluki kya dyntari te ccaw phe ka zei vae, <verse number="4" style="v" />tuh-e ccaw he na ria oh te, Khri kya-e byakhupaw ka nynaw kong kha na thaethya cih oh,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.4-6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 1:26-27">Kol 1.26-27</ref></char></note> <verse number="5" style="v" />tuh-e byakhupaw tuh atu lya Muisaw liate athyaapaw a locceihtu hae te a profeh hae kya a phypya hae hawte, langmaw she lya-e ccungccaw hae kha la phypah khyh hae. <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuh-e tuh: Thehoypaw liate Zenta hae mah rho a ccou buapaw lang a tang hae, pyn pynkheit kya-e hae thua hae zah byakinpyakunaw kha Khri Jesu kya a neethungkuh bua hae paw nynh thua hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A huhan ryalawnaw liate kae yn pyapaw Pachia thawccinaw lasung thyhte, kae tuh tuh-e thehoypaw te asekuhpaw ryalahtu lang ka tang. <verse number="8" style="v" />Kae tuh mithyaa hae balyn kyaze anyaa huaccepaw ka thua salamah, Khri kya-e tou kho um leipaw thehoypaw hoirumnaw kha Zenta hae kalan ho khylan hynh-e thawccinaw hynh kamaw yn pya, <verse number="9" style="v" />pawpaw balyn a raetupaw Pachia kya langmaw she te thuruh athuapaw byakhupaw te asekuhpaw paccynnaw tuh pawmou athua cipaw kha ccungccaw miakaw muihsah khylan hynh-e thawccinaw hynh kamaw yn pya; <verse number="10" style="v" />tuhte muihsah a rynawpaw tuh Pachia hawnaw aphuinphuin kha vaawlang e uktu hae kalan te kawhoitu hae kalan khriccaawbuu liate atu nysah bua athua nawlan nynh thua. <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuh-e tuh Pachia nynh zungzae atynpaw a eenaw thyhte ah Bawipaw Khri Jesu kya a ccingsahpaw nynh thua. <verse number="12" style="v" />Khri zynnaw liate aening tuh zynkunaw te rawhoynaw khate Pachia kalan naeku khonaw kha amaw kya ah hoi oh. <verse number="13" style="v" />Tukeiccuze nae hanlan ka teingpaw vawsawnaw hae keiccuze nae lungthang khyh nawlan kae ngia oh; tuh-e hae tuh nanning phu-enaw nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="s1">Ccawriatu hae hanlan Sawsangnaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hynh-e keiccu nynh kae tuh Paaw malang ccukharu ka tung. <verse number="15" style="v" />Vaaw te lae kya umpaw innbyn miakaw tuh amaw kyate nynh minphu athua hae. <verse number="16" style="v" />Saw ka sangpaw tuh: a phu-enaw kya-e hoirumnaw thyhte a Muisaw thungnaw liate nae lungkhu lang e ccungccaw thuanaw kha thawzung ae hoisah nawlan oh, <verse number="17" style="v" />te nanning tuh sungsakunaw kya tharui sawte bing na thua oh zah, zynnaw liate Khri tuh nae thinlung kya a um nawlan saw ka sang. <verse number="18" style="v" />Mithyaa hae balyn ryte Khri kya-e sungsahnaw akopaw, asaepaw, akhupaw te ahangpaw kha na nythya nawlan oh, <verse number="19" style="v" />nynaw po alawepaw Khri sungsahnaw kha na ny nawlan oh te Pachia kya-e ccingnaw balyn khate phe na bia nawlan oh saw ka sang.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Atu aening lungkhu kya ryalahpaw thungnaw liate aening nynh ah ngia oh paw balyn, tuhkhyhze ah tua oh paw balyn laeze myaryamaw alunghua lante a cyih khopaw Pachia tuh, <verse number="21" style="v" />Khri Jesu liate khriccaawbuu kya zungzae te zungzae cia she takyh a phu-e sah. Amen.</para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Khri Pyn kya Lungngingnaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Bawipaw keiccuze thongccahpaw kae, Paul nynh ko na thua oh paw nanning kha, tuh-e konaw te angaekuh lante na hiin nawlan oh kae ngia oh. <verse number="2" style="v" />Pawpaw balyn kya zakawsangsakunaw, lungnenaw, lungsaenaw te um oh, sungsakunaw kya lu kheit te lu kheit ngaesangnaw hoi oh,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 3:12-13">Kol 3.12-13</ref></char></note> <verse number="3" style="v" />nanning ae suelua oh paw daenaw liate Muisaw kya-e lungngingnaw kha tynsah khylan thawte zuakuh oh. <verse number="4" style="v" />Nanning ae konuathe oh paw ngaehoinaw tuh ccangkheit kyalya athua hawte, pyn pynkheit, Muisaw ccangkheit kyalya nynh a um, <verse number="5" style="v" />Bawipaw ccangkheit, zynnaw ccangkheit, baptisma ccangkheit, <verse number="6" style="v" />pawpaw balyn Paaw athuapaw Pachia ccangkheit nynh a um; tuh-e Pachia tuh pawpaw balyn luki a umpaw, teitei balyn kya a umpaw te pawpaw balyn kya a umpaw nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Thuasalama Khri nynh oun pyapaw lasung tounawpaw thyhte aening lu raveih nynh thawccinaw kha ah mue oh. <verse number="8" style="v" />Tukeiccuze,</para>
  <para style="q1">“Aning nynh ahangnaw lang</para>
  <para style="q2">he a kaethung te,</para>
  <para style="q1">kyngpaw ccungccaw hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">a cciakhae hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">a ccungccaw hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">lasung a pya hae,”</para>
  <para style="m">cite a ho.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 68:18">Sam 68.18</ref></char></note> <verse number="9" style="v" />(“Aning tuh a kaethung” a cipaw hynh, aning tuh laephi ane huanaw kalan mah a rungbung cinawpaw nynh thua. <verse number="10" style="v" />Yn rungbungpaw aning tuh pawpaw balyn kha phe biasah khylan, vaawlang abalyn hae luki lang a kaethungpaw kha nynh thua.) <verse number="11" style="v" />Aning nynh a pya hae paw lasung tuh, ccungccaw abang kha locceihtu lang, abang kha profeh lang, abang kha thehoypaw phytu lang, abang kha pastor lang te ccangpahtu lang a nung hae, <verse number="12" style="v" />tuhte a pya hae paw tuh Khri pyn kha thawzung tynsah khylan, ryalawnaw hanlan mithyaa hae kha paccyn khylan nynh thua; <verse number="13" style="v" />tuh-e paccynnaw tuh aening balyn nynh zynnaw kya thuasah, Pachia Ccapaw nynaw kya thuasah lunglokunaw ah hoi oh zah, Khri kya-e accingpaw ccungccaw tounawpaw thyhte piccan athuakuh cia paccynnaw nynh thua; <verse number="14" style="v" />ou tuhte ccungccaw hae nynh hynpyanaw liate, a cyisakuh thyapaw thyaruhnaw te a pheethyapaw pheenaw kya ccangpyanaw khisan miakaw nynh po cciakhae hae zah nulang malang a hekuh hae paw imua hae thua vae leite, <verse number="15" style="v" />sungsakunaw kya byaccing kha hote, aening tuh lu athuapaw Khri kyakhe pawpaw kya balyn ah lethung nawlan oh, <verse number="16" style="v" />tuh-e lu kyate atungkunaw miakaw nynh thawpya zah pyn balyn tuh rekuhmamia lan tungkuh hae zah akyngkuh hae, pyn kya-e raveih nynh ccungkia lan rya a law hae thyhte, sungsakunaw kya tuh-e pyn tuh tynsathung nawlan pyn kha a lethungsah.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 2:19">Kol 2.19</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="s1">Hiinnaw Arynpaw te Athawpaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tukeiccuze tuhlaepaw Zenta hae nynh accakaepaw mih tuanaw kya a hiin hae hawte nanning nynh na hiinbua khyh nawlan oh e hynh ka ho zah Bawipaw kya ccaekia ka khan. <verse number="18" style="v" />Minmin kya nythyanaw kharouh a um khyh keiccu, mih thinlung mitmoh keiccu, mih thaethyanaw tuh karae amoh, Pachia kya-e hiinnaw kyate phe a phiakuh vae hae. <verse number="19" style="v" />Minmin tuh maethya ny leite, eih duaanaw te nungsikunaw tynre kha cyi khylan mimaw te mimaw kha ohhuaku rynaw kalan a apku hae. <verse number="20" style="v" />Thuasalama nanning tuh Khri kong kha tuhte na ccangkuh khyh oh; <verse number="21" style="v" />byaccing tuh Jesu kya a um hawte, amaw kong kha nanning nynh phe na thae vae oh zah amaw nynh phe ae ccangpya vae oh lanze, <verse number="22" style="v" />langmaw nae ozia te asekuh lante ahynthyapaw ryduaanaw thyhte phe aroh vae paw arynpaw ccungccaw kha na vua nawlan oh,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 3:9">Kol 3.9</ref></char></note> <verse number="23" style="v" />te nae thinlung te nae tuanaw kha thawsah te na um nawlan oh, <verse number="24" style="v" />te ahmepaw dingnaw kya te thyaanaw kya Pachia hawmawte rae athuapaw, athawpaw ccungccaw kha nanning nynh na lawku nawlan oh nynh thua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 1:26">Gen 1.26</ref>; <ref loc="COL 3:10">Kol 3.10</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="s1">Hiinnaw Thawpaw elang Phung hae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tukeiccuze hynbya kha nung biate, nanning lu raveih nynh nae innpaw hae ryte byaccing kha ho oh, pawccecize aening tuh lu kheit te lu kheit pyn kya-e hae nynh ah thua oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 8:16">Zek 8.16</ref></char></note> <verse number="26" style="v" />Nae thinria salamah sei nan oh, nae thinrianaw khate khuanin ccawsah nan oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 4:4">Sam 4.4</ref> (LXX)</char></note> <verse number="27" style="v" />Satan kha umnaw ua nan oh. <verse number="28" style="v" />Aruhpaw ccungccaw nynh kharouh ruh nan vae sah, thuasalama ahoboupaw ccungccaw kha pyabua lanpaw a hoi nawlan, amaw a kuih te ahoypaw ryalaw kha zuakute lah sah. <verse number="29" style="v" />Anungsikuhpaw bya kaw kheit san nae khalang kyate pou nan sah. Thuasalama a thaetu hae kha Pachia thawccinaw a neethungbua nawlan, thawzung tynsathungnaw hanlan athanepaw ahoypaw bya palia kha pousah oh. <verse number="30" style="v" />Sawkhawnaw nin hanlan nanning tazeih ae khianaw oh paw, Pachia Thyaa Muisaw kha thinlungccisah nan oh. <verse number="31" style="v" />Thinlung kya phang poipaw balyn, bungpawnaw, thinrianaw, sianuakupaw, te thethya hokupaw, milae rosah rynawpaw balyn kha nae kyate vua oh. <verse number="32" style="v" />lu kheit te lu kheit thawccihkuh thya oh lah ngaethyaumsakuh oh, Khri kya Pachia nynh ae ngaethya vae oh hawte lu kheit te lu kheit ngaethyakuh oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.32: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 3:13">Kol 3.13</ref></char></note></para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Pachia nynh kou a sungsahpaw ccaaw hae na thua oh hawte, Pachia a dosuinkuh hae paw thua oh. <verse number="2" style="v" />Khri nynh aening kha yn sungsah pawte, Pachia malang mynkhuhpaw pyapaw te silawkunaw lang amaw te amaw kha aening hanlan a pyaku hawte, sungsakunaw kya hiin oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 29:18">Exo 29.18</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 40:6">Sam 40.6</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="s1">Lawki Hiinzia Vuanaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ohhuakunaw, athyaa leipaw aphuinphuin, tuhkhyhze karankunaw kha nanning laku bya te sanmah ho nan oh, tuh-e hae tuh mithyaa hae te ngaekuh khyh; <verse number="4" style="v" />byathupaw, ngaeenaw bya te angaekuh leipaw bya kha ho leite, lungtuabya palia kha ho oh. <verse number="5" style="v" />Pawccecize, a ohhuakuhpaw, athyaa leipaw, zohtuh beik zah a karankuhpaw ccungccaw tuh Khri te Pachia peenaw kya rho uccaw kharouh hoibua khyh cipaw ccaerarih lan na ny oh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Accakaepaw bya hae khate hum nynh san ae la ling nan oh sah; pawccecize khahcihawpaw uccaw hae keiccuze Pachia thinrianaw tuh kawngae lei hae paw tungvaw a ccah. <verse number="7" style="v" />Tukeiccuze minmin ryte la mungkuh nan oh. <verse number="8" style="v" />Pawccecize langmawlya nanning tuh mohnaw nynh na la thua oh, thuasalama atu tuh Bawipaw kya awnaw nynh na thua vae oh; tukeiccuze awnaw ccaaw hae hawte hiin oh. <verse number="9" style="v" />Pawccecize awnaw athae tuh hoynaw aphuinphuin, dingnaw aphuinphuin te byaccing aphuinphuin kya muih athua. <verse number="10" style="v" />Bawipaw lungrythuapaw uccaw kha ccangku lan zuakuh oh. <verse number="11" style="v" />Athane leipaw mohnaw ryalaw hae kya panbua nan oh, tuh-e ryalaw hae kha langsakuh paleih oh. <verse number="12" style="v" />Pawccecize minmin nynh aphiruh lante a cyi hae paw tuh-e uccaw hae kong kha ho lan heize maethya lan umpaw nynh thua. <verse number="13" style="v" />Thuasalama pawpaw balyn tuh awnaw liate langsah he athua te ccaerarih lan muih kho athua, pawccecize pawpaw balyn a langsah thyapaw tuh awnaw nynh thua. <verse number="14" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Pachia nynh,</para>
  <para style="q1">“A ihpaw nang, tho ccavae!</para>
  <para style="q2">Chinaw kyate thoo lah</para>
  <para style="q1">Khri nynh nang kha</para>
  <para style="q2">awnaw ae pya cih,” a ci.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tukeiccuze angaeepaw hawte thua leite, ahawpaw hawte raeringkute hiin oh. <verse number="16" style="v" />Ninsaw hae tuh ahoy vae khyh keiccuze accyh kha mangkuh thya oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 4:5">Kol 4.5</ref></char></note> <verse number="17" style="v" />Tukeiccuze ngaee nan vae oh, Bawipaw rynaw tuh paw nynh thua cipaw kha thaethya ccavae oh. <verse number="18" style="v" />Misutui rui nan oh, pawccecize tuh-e tuh hoysahnaw alawepaw nynh thua, tuhlaeze Muisaw khate phe beih oh. <verse number="19" style="v" />Sam hlaw hae, thehoysahnaw hlaw hae te muisaw hlaw hae khate lu kheit te lu kheit byahokuh oh lah, nae thinlung kya ahoypaw roisaw biate Bawipaw kalan hlawsah oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.19-20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 3:16-17">Kol 3.16-17</ref></char></note> <verse number="20" style="v" />Ah Bawipaw Jesu Khri min te Paaw Pachia kalan pawpaw balyn hanlan lungtuabya zungzae ho oh.</para>
  <para style="s1">Khriccaaw Innbyn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Pachia rawri sawtuanaw liate lu kheit te lu kheit nae rynaw zuipakuh oh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Zu hae, Bawipaw rynaw na zui oh hawte, nae vawpaw hae rynaw kha zui oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 3:18">Kol 3.18</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 3:1">1Pe 3.1</ref></char></note> <verse number="23" style="v" />Pawccecize Khri tuh khriccaawbuu lu athua hawte, vawpaw tuh zu lu nynh thua; Khri tuh amaw pyn athuapaw khriccaawbuu Khumtu nynh athua. <verse number="24" style="v" />Tukeiccuze khriccaawbuu nynh Khri rynaw a zui hawte zu hae nynh mah pawpaw balyn kya mih vawpaw hae rynaw kha zui hae sah.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Vawpaw hae, Khri nynh khriccaawbuu kha sungsah zah khriccaawbuu hanlan a pyaku hawte, nae zu hae kha sungsah oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 3:19">Kol 3.19</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 3:7">1Pe 3.7</ref></char></note> <verse number="26" style="v" />Khri nynh tuhte a cyipaw tuh, khriccaawbuu kha Pachia bya athuapaw tui te singpyanaw liate a thyaa ccaw cite ccikan khylan, <verse number="27" style="v" />te akalouhkuhpaw khyhze akhinkuhpaw, tuhkhyhze khahcihawpaw ccangkhakheit sanmah um leite, khriccaawbuu kha amaw kalan phu-enaw te thuakhae khylan, te khriccaawbuu tuh athyaa nawlan te ccaenaw um khyh nawlan nynh thua. <verse number="28" style="v" />Tukeiccuze vawpaw hae nynh mimaw mih pyn a sungsah hae hawte mih zu hae kha a sungsah hae aho. A zu a sungsahpaw tuh amaw a sungsakuhpaw nynh thua. <verse number="29" style="v" />Pawccecize amaw a pyn a huapaw hum sanmah um khyh, Khri nynh khriccaawbuu kha do-oih zah a kua hawte, amaw pyn kha do-oih zah a kua, <verse number="30" style="v" />pawccecize aening tuh amaw a pyn kya-e hae nynh ah thua oh. <verse number="31" style="v" />“Hynh-e keiccuze pise nynh a nung te a paaw kha a cciataw cih zah a zu te a umkheih cih hae, minmin lu ning tuh pyn pynkheit lang a tang cih hae.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.31: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:24">Gen 2.24</ref></char></note> <verse number="32" style="v" />E tuh myarya byakhupaw thua zah, Khri te khriccaawbuu kong kha nynh ka ho. <verse number="33" style="v" />Tuhzemah nanning lu raveih nynh naemaw na sungsaku oh hawte nae zu hae kha sungsah oh, te zu nynh a vawpaw kha saw a tua cih.</para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Ccaaw hae te Nungpaaw hae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Imua hae, Bawipaw kya nae nung nae paaw hae bya kha ngae oh, pawccecize tuh-e tuh ahmepaw nynh thua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 3:20">Kol 3.20</ref></char></note> <verse number="2" style="v" />“Na nung te na paaw kha sawtua”—hynh-e hynh byakinpyakupaw te asekuhpaw masaty kawbya nynh thua,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.2-3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:12">Exo 20.12</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:16">Deu 5.16</ref></char></note> <verse number="3" style="v" />tuh-e byakinpyakunaw tuh, “tuhteze nynh hiinhoy te na um cih zah laephi vawlan na hiinshe sae cih,” acikuh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Paaw hae, nae ccaaw hae kha thinriasah nan oh, thuasalama Bawipaw kya-e ccangpyanaw te thuiheinaw khate minmin kha cciakhae thung oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 3:21">Kol 3.21</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="s1">See hae te Bawizuaa hae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />See hae, Khri kaw na ngae oh hawte, rawri thyngkute, thinlung thanccingte pynsaw lante nae bawi hae kaw kha ngae oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.5-8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 3:22-25">Kol 3.22-25</ref></char></note> <verse number="6" style="v" />Ccungccaw lungrythuasah khylan, muihnaw kya kyalya kawngaepaw thua leite, Khri see hae hawte Pachia rynaw kha thinlung ccaccing te cyih oh, <verse number="7" style="v" />ccungccaw hae hanlan thua leite, Bawipaw hanlan ryalawpyapaw hawte, ahoypaw thinlung khate ryalah oh. <verse number="8" style="v" />See athua zemah, a luepaw athua zemah, lukhakheit nynh ahoypaw kha a cyi ze, Bawipaw kyate atekuhpaw lasung kha a mue cih cipaw nyh oh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Bawi hae, nae see hae tungvaw kya tuhawte cyihbua oh. Minmin kha huraw nan oh, pawccecize nanning te minmin nynh vaawlang khua kya alokuhpaw Bawi na hoi oh zah, aning tuh hum sanmah maedo khyh cipaw nyh oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 10:17">Deu 10.17</ref>; <ref loc="COL 3:25">Kol 3.25</ref>, <ref loc="COL 4:1">4.1</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="s1">Pachia kya-e Rhawtuk-uccaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nyathyakou ka uno hae, Bawipaw kya te a thungnaw thawzung kyakhe nae thawsae sah. <verse number="11" style="v" />Satan lingnaw kha na dou kho nawlan oh Pachia kya-e rhawtuk-uccaw kha abalyn mawte lawkuh oh. <verse number="12" style="v" />Pawccecize aening tuh chii te saw a hoipaw rhaw te ah doukuh khyh oh, thuasalama uktu hae, kawhoitu hae, hynh-e she mohnaw kya-e laephi uktu hae, vaawlang umpaw ahoy leipaw muisaw hae ryte nynh ah douku oh. <verse number="13" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Pachia kya-e rhawtuk-uccaw kha abalyn mawte lawkuh oh, tuhteze nynh nin hoy leipaw kya na dou kho cih oh zah pawpaw balyn thangsah te tynkaring lan na thadyn kho cih oh. <verse number="14" style="v" />Tukeiccuze byaccing athuapaw taeccia khate nae tae kha cciaku te, dingnaw athuapaw bykhaw kha khawkuh oh,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 11:5">Isa 11.5</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 59:17">59.17</ref></char></note> <verse number="15" style="v" />daenaw athuapaw thehoypaw kha phy khylan paccynkunaw kha ccukoh lang kohkuh oh, <verse number="16" style="v" />tuh-e hae balyn laelan, zynnaw athuapaw khawriaphua kha ccyngkuh oh lah, tuh-e tuhte raerangsaro kya-e maee lang ruapaw thee hae balyn kha na the kho cih oh. <verse number="17" style="v" />Khumnaw athuapaw sivawlukhung te Pachia bya athuapaw Muisaw thaloi kha ccyngkuh oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 59:17">Isa 59.17</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Sawsangnaw te ngianaw phuin balyn khate Muisaw kya sawsang zungzae oh. Mithyaa hae balyn hanlan ngia oh lah, lungthang leite zuaku biate raeringkute um oh. <verse number="19" style="v" />Thehoypaw kya-e byakhupaw kha rawhoyte ka nysah nawlan hae, bya ka ho vae ze ka ho lanpaw thehoypaw kha yn pya nawlan kae ka hanlan mah sawsang oh. <verse number="20" style="v" />Kae tuh tuh-e thehoypaw hanlan sivawrui te a khii hae paw locceihtu nynh ka thua; tukeiccuze ho lan ka ccan thyhte rawhoyte ka ho kho nawlan saw yn sangpah oh.</para>
  <para style="s1">Nyathya Beihlangnaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ka tungvaw acyihkuhpaw te ka cyipaw kha na ny nawlan oh, Taikhikas nynh pawpaw balyn kha marya ae la hopah cih oh; aning tuh sungsahpaw uno thua zah Bawipaw kya a lungzipaw ryalahtu nynh thua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 20:4">Loc 20.4</ref>; <ref loc="2TI 4:12">2Ti 4.12</ref></char></note><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.21-22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 4:7-8">Kol 4.7-8</ref></char></note> <verse number="22" style="v" />Kae tungvaw acyihkuhpaw te nae thinlung kha ngaengansah khylan eenaw te kae nynh amaw kha nae kalan kae saw.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Paaw Pachia te Bawipaw Jesu Khri kyate daenaw, zynnaw te sungsakunaw tuh uno hae kyakhe la um sah. <verse number="24" style="v" />Ah Bawipaw Jesu Khri kha tynkaring lan a sungsah hae paw balyn kya thawccinaw tuh la um sah. Amen.</para>
</usx>